      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אָבִיב</span></big> <strong>subst. masc.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Leviticus 2:14\" href=\"/Leviticus.2.14\">Lv 2:14</a></sup> <strong>colet.</strong> (Lag<sup>BN 207</sup> Inf.).<br><strong>1.</strong> <strong>Espigas novas e tenras</strong> de cevada, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:31\" href=\"/Exodus.9.31\">Êx 9:31</a>; uso indefinido em <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 2:14\" href=\"/Leviticus.2.14\">Lv 2:14</a>: <span dir=\"rtl\">מִנְחַת בִּכּוּרִים ליהוה א׳ קָלוּי בָּאֵשׁ</span>.<br><strong>2.</strong> <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹדֶשׁ הָֽאָבִיב</span>, mês da formação das espigas ou do reverdecimento, <strong>Abibe</strong>, mês do êxodo e da Páscoa, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 13:4\" href=\"/Exodus.13.4\">Êx 13:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 23:15\" href=\"/Exodus.23.15\">23:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 34:18\" href=\"/Exodus.34.18\">34:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 34:18\" href=\"/Exodus.34.18\">18</a> (JE), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 16:1\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.16.1\">Dt 16:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 16:1\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.16.1\">1</a> (primeiro mês = aproximadamente abril = <span dir=\"rtl\">הָרִאשֹׁן</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הַחֹדֶשׁ הָר׳</span> [ver verbete] em P; ver Di, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:2\" href=\"/Exodus.12.2\">Êx 12:2</a>; = <span dir=\"rtl\">נִיסָן</span> pós-exílico [ver verbete]).",
