      "ordinal": 15,
      "headword": "אֶבְיוֹן",
      "ref": "BDB, אֶבְיוֹן",
      "preview": "Adjetivo e substantivo: necessitado, carente, pobre; usos sociais e religiosos.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֶבְיוֹן</span></big>  <strong>adj. carente, necessitado, pobre</strong>,—sempre no estado absoluto, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 15:4\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.15.4\">Dt 15:4</a> + 40 ocorrências; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶבְיֹנְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 23:6\" href=\"/Exodus.23.6\">Ex 23:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 15:11\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.15.11\">Dt 15:11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶבְיוֹנִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 4:1\" href=\"/Amos.4.1\">Am 4:1</a> + 14 ocorrências; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶבְיוֹנֵי (אֶבְיֹנֵי)</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 23:11\" href=\"/Exodus.23.11\">Ex 23:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 29:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.29.19\">Is 29:19</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶבְיוֹנֶיהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 132:15\" href=\"/Psalms.132.15\">ψ 132:15</a>—(no Hexateuco, somente em JED; sobretudo em poesia, 23 ocorrências em ψ) <em>necessitado</em>, principalmente <em>pobre</em> (em termos materiais); como adjetivo: <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 15:7\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.15.7\">Dt 15:7</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 15:9\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.15.9\">9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 24:14\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.24.14\">24:14</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 109:16\" href=\"/Psalms.109.16\">ψ 109:16</a> (ambas em paralelismo com <span dir=\"rtl\">עָנִי</span>); em outros lugares, substantivo; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 49:3\" href=\"/Psalms.49.3\">ψ 49:3</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עָשׁיר</span>); <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 15:4\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.15.4\">Dt 15:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 15:11\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.15.11\">11</a>; sujeito à opressão e aos maus-tratos: <a data-ref=\"Amos 2:6\" href=\"/Amos.2.6\">Am 2:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Amos 5:12\" href=\"/Amos.5.12\">5:12</a> (ambos em paralelismo com <span dir=\"rtl\">צַדִּיק</span>) <a data-ref=\"Amos 4:1\" href=\"/Amos.4.1\">4:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Amos 8:6\" href=\"/Amos.8.6\">8:6</a> (todos em paralelismo com <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּל</span>) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 32:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.32.7\">Is 32:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Amos 8:4\" href=\"/Amos.8.4\">Am 8:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:49\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.49\">Ez 16:49</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 18:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.18.12\">18:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 22:29\" href=\"/Ezekiel.22.29\">22:29</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 37:14\" href=\"/Psalms.37.14\">ψ 37:14</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 24:4\" href=\"/Job.24.4\">Jb 24:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Job 24:14\" href=\"/Job.24.14\">14</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 30:14\" href=\"/Proverbs.30.14\">Pr 30:14</a>—cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 109:16\" href=\"/Psalms.109.16\">ψ 109:16</a> acima.—(todos em paralelismo com <span dir=\"rtl\">עָנִי</span>) <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 5:28\" href=\"/Jeremiah.5.28\">Je 5:28</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יָתוֹם</span>) <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 2:34\" href=\"/Jeremiah.2.34\">2:34</a>; objeto dos cuidados dos bons: <a data-ref=\"Job 29:16\" href=\"/Job.29.16\">Jb 29:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 30:25\" href=\"/Job.30.25\">30:25</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">קְשֵׁה־יוֹם</span>) <a data-ref=\"Job 31:19\" href=\"/Job.31.19\">31:19</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 112:9\" href=\"/Psalms.112.9\">ψ 112:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Esther 9:22\" href=\"/Esther.9.22\">Est 9:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:31\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.31\">Pr 14:31</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּל</span>) <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 31:20\" href=\"/Proverbs.31.20\">31:20</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 22:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.22.16\">Je 22:16</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עָנִי</span>); ordena-se o cuidado para com eles, negativamente: <a data-ref=\"Exodus 23:6\" href=\"/Exodus.23.6\">Ex 23:6</a>; cf. <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 24:14\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.24.14\">Dt 24:14</a> acima.—positivamente: <a data-ref=\"Exodus 23:11\" href=\"/Exodus.23.11\">Ex 23:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 15:11\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.15.11\">Dt 15:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 31:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.31.9\">Pr 31:9</a> (ambos em paralelismo com <span dir=\"rtl\">עָנִי</span>)—cf. <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 15:7\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.15.7\">Dt 15:7</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 15:9\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.15.9\">9</a> acima.—<a data-ref=\"Psalms 82:4\" href=\"/Psalms.82.4\">ψ 82:4</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּל</span>; objeto dos cuidados de Deus: <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 20:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.20.13\">Je 20:13</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 107:41\" href=\"/Psalms.107.41\">ψ 107:41</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 132:15\" href=\"/Psalms.132.15\">132:15</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 5:15\" href=\"/Job.5.15\">Jb 5:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:8\" href=\"/I_Samuel.2.8\">1 S 2:8</a> = <a data-ref=\"Psalms 113:7\" href=\"/Psalms.113.7\">ψ 113:7</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 14:30\" href=\"/Isaiah.14.30\">Is 14:30</a> (all ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּל</span>) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 35:10\" href=\"/Psalms.35.10\">ψ 35:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 140:13\" href=\"/Psalms.140.13\">140:13</a> (ambos em paralelismo com <span dir=\"rtl\">עָנִי</span>), cf. o rei davídico: <a data-ref=\"Psalms 72:12\" href=\"/Psalms.72.12\">ψ 72:12</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עָנִי</span>) = v <a data-ref=\"Psalms 72:4\" href=\"/Psalms.72.4\">4</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵי אֶבְ׳</span> (‖ <em>idem</em>), v <a data-ref=\"Psalms 72:13\" href=\"/Psalms.72.13\">13</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּל</span>); <em>necessitado de ajuda</em>, de libertação da aflição, especialmente quando liberto por Deus: <a data-ref=\"Psalms 9:19\" href=\"/Psalms.9.19\">ψ 9:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 12:6\" href=\"/Psalms.12.6\">12:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 40:18\" href=\"/Psalms.40.18\">40:18</a> = <a data-ref=\"Psalms 70:6\" href=\"/Psalms.70.6\">70:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 74:21\" href=\"/Psalms.74.21\">74:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 86:1\" href=\"/Psalms.86.1\">86:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 109:22\" href=\"/Psalms.109.22\">109:22</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 29:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.29.19\">Is 29:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 41:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.41.17\">41:17</a> (all ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עָנִי</span>) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 25:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.25.4\">Is 25:4</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּל</span>) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 69:34\" href=\"/Psalms.69.34\">ψ 69:34</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 109:31\" href=\"/Psalms.109.31\">109:31</a>.",
