      "preview": "אֵבֶל: luto, pelos mortos ou por calamidade; duração e vestes de luto.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֵ֫בֶל</span></big>  <strong>substantivo masculino.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Genesis 50:11\" href=\"/Genesis.50.11\">Gn 50:11</a></sup> <strong>luto</strong> — estado absoluto: <a data-ref=\"Genesis 50:10\" href=\"/Genesis.50.10\">Gn 50:10</a> + 17 ocorrências; estado construto: <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:41\" href=\"/Genesis.27.41\">27:41</a> + 3 ocorrências; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶבְלֵךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 60:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.60.20\">Is 60:20</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶבְלָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.13\">Je 31:13</a> — pelos mortos, estado construto: <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:41\" href=\"/Genesis.27.41\">Gn 27:41</a> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 34:8\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.34.8\">Dt 34:8</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">בּכי</span>) assim também <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ יָחִיד</span> como símile de luto intenso: <a data-ref=\"Amos 8:10\" href=\"/Amos.8.10\">Am 8:10</a>, <em>idem</em> metaforicamente: <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 6:26\" href=\"/Jeremiah.6.26\">Je 6:26</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מִסְפַּד תַּמְרוּרִים</span>); <a data-ref=\"Genesis 50:11\" href=\"/Genesis.50.11\">Gn 50:11</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 16:7\" href=\"/Jeremiah.16.7\">Je 16:7</a>; cf. <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 19:3\" href=\"/II_Samuel.19.3\">2 S 19:3</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">עשה א׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 24:17\" href=\"/Ezekiel.24.17\">Ez 24:17</a> (ver Co), seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">לְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 50:10\" href=\"/Genesis.50.10\">Gn 50:10</a> (ver também II. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אָבֵל²\" href=\"/BDB,_אָבֵל²\", dir=\"rtl\">אָבֵל</a> ao final); por calamidade: <a data-ref=\"Esther 4:3\" href=\"/Esther.4.3\">Est 4:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Esther 9:22\" href=\"/Esther.9.22\">9:22</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יָגוֹן</span>; em contraste com <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹם טוֹב</span>) <a data-ref=\"Job 30:31\" href=\"/Job.30.31\">Jb 30:31</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">קול בכים</span>) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 60:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.60.20\">Is 60:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 61:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.61.3\">61:3</a> (aqui aparentemente = vestes de luto, seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעֲטֵה תְהִלָּה</span>; ver também Bi Che sobre o texto; em paralelismo com <span dir=\"rtl\">רוּחַ כֵּהָה</span>; em contraste com <span dir=\"rtl\">שֶׁמֶן שָׂשׂוֹן</span>); <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.13\">Je 31:13</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂשׂון</span>), <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 5:15\" href=\"/Lamentations.5.15\">La 5:15</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מָחוֹל</span>), <a data-ref=\"Amos 5:16\" href=\"/Amos.5.16\">Am 5:16</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מִסְפֵּד</span>); cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ כִּבְנוֹת יַעֲנָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Micah 1:8\" href=\"/Micah.1.8\">Mi 1:8</a>; = tempo, período de luto: <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 11:27\" href=\"/II_Samuel.11.27\">2 S 11:27</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּית א׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 7:2\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.7.2\">Ec 7:2</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">בּ׳ מִשְׁתֶּה</span> (ver <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 7:4\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.7.4\">4</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">בּ׳ שִׂמְחָה</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּגְדֵי א׳</span> vestes de luto: <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 14:2\" href=\"/II_Samuel.14.2\">2 S 14:2</a>.",
